<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 12,280 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,800 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  299     (299 and     261)</p>
<p>    Good		135     (135 and     135)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     116     (112 and     100)</p>
<p>    Medium	    107     (106 and	86)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 85 nom ( 84 nom and  68)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 299 pence for a Burundi PD.</p>
</text>
